# spec: real-world -- JSONPlaceholder CRUD walk-through
@api = https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com

### list-posts
GET {{api}}/posts?_limit=5
### one-post
GET {{api}}/posts/1
### create-post
POST {{api}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "title": "foo",
  "body": "bar",
  "userId": 1
}
### update-post
PUT {{api}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{ "id": 1, "title": "foo", "body": "bar", "userId": 1 }
### patch-post
PATCH {{api}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{ "title": "updated" }
### delete-post
DELETE {{api}}/posts/1
### nested
GET {{api}}/posts/1/comments
